                    "sections.about": "01 / About",
                    "sections.experience": "02 / Experience",
                    "sections.portfolio": "03 / Portfolio",
                    "sections.skills": "04 / Skills",
                    "sections.contact": "05 / Contact",
                    "about.heading": "Curious by<br /><em>nature.</em>",
                    "about.intro":
                        "Hello World! My name is Jovan Sitaric, a front-end developer, web and graphic designer based in Serbia.",
                    "about.detail":
                        "I have been in love with web development since I stopped being crazy about cartoons. I am always willing to go the extra mile to make a website neater, faster and prettier.",
                    "experience.eyebrow": "A history of making things",
